	(text "R17/R18: 27k always in, into stock Evo AUDIO IN (10k || 47k): 1.37 Vpp at DAC full scale (2.1 Vrms).\nLouder: bridge JP5/JP6 (bottom) centre pad to 15k (+R21/R23 34k: 15.05k, 2.06 Vpp, +3.5 dB)\nor to 9k1 (+R20/R22 13.7k: 9.09k, 2.75 Vpp, +6.0 dB). Same on both channels; never all three pads." (at 18 254 0)
